Subject: Select original debug-camera desktop controls with explicit native inputs

Upstream-base: 389ec8223cba8dda09934884b1a2967704bec363

Select matching orbit/pan/radius/height, input-toggle and view math independently
of global pad/task/tweak initialization. The port owner supplies checked desktop
pad values and diagnostic task/profiler flags. Wii DPD and player/replay target
services reject explicitly. Defer constructor Update until the owner installs
its input scope, initialize native-only formerly unused fields, and define the
original low-16-bit angle conversion without out-of-range float-to-short casts.
Reject a degenerate float look-at direction before its original normalization.
Console source remains unchanged outside its native selection guard.

